@startuml
actor Student
participant BookingService
participant BookingRepository
Student -> BookingService: createBooking(roomId, start, end)
BookingService -> BookingRepository: saveBooking(roomId, start, end)
BookingRepository --> BookingService: booking saved
BookingService -> BookingRepository: checkAvailability(roomId, start, end)
BookingRepository --> BookingService: available or blocked
alt created
  BookingService --> Student: send confirmation
else unavailable
  BookingService --> Student: reject booking
end
note over BookingService
  Assumption: availability is checked after the reservation is saved.
  BookingService coordinates the request; BookingRepository stores bookings.
end note
@enduml
